  ArrowRight, BookOpen, GraduationCap, Search, Menu, X, UserRound, LogOut, EyeOff,
  ShieldCheck, LayoutDashboard, Plus, FileText, Heart, Bell, ShoppingBag,
  Wallet, CheckCircle2, Clock3, AlertCircle, UploadCloud, Download, Star,
